        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h1>TWO YEARS OF PRODUCTION IS FINALLY OVER! RELEASE SOON!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948190/extras/a7b56f4290f466290b56453b8dd48eed.avif?t=1779055517\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“The wind rises… They say that the gaas resembles the raging ocean, but to me it is just like the sky… I guess that during the short winter one can see the gaas in its purest form,” thought Marena Chudskaya.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel <strong>Rattenwalzer</strong> is a story about the human willpower that regardless of sufferings and terrors lasting thousands of years has kept its beautiful nature. This visual novel comprehends such matters as the nature of the human and machine mind as a combination of the conscious and subconscious, coming of age and searching for personal happiness, the origin of interpersonal conflicts, hatred and violence, the willpower and strength to stay human even in the darkest of times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marena Chudskaya</strong>, who calls herself <i>‘an ever-burning star’</i>, is the main character who accidentally falls into a trap designed for the ‘gods’ of the new world. Standing at the crossway of the past and the present, she gets pulled into a conflict with people… beings…  monsters…, who are ready to do whatever it takes to change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two</strong> chapters are available for gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter I: The Zugzwang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter II: Main Residential Complex Sun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two</strong> more chapters are currently in production:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter III: Main Residential Complex Bes’</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter IV: The Bull</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achtung! Attention! Read before playing:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This product may contain visual effects that can trigger epileptic seizures in some individuals. If you experience dizziness, confusion, visual disturbances, or seizures, stop using the product immediately and consult a doctor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“The wind rises… They say that the gaas resembles the raging ocean, but to me it is just like the sky… I guess that during the short winter one can see the gaas in its purest form,” thought Marena Chudskaya.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel <strong>Rattenwalzer</strong> is a story about the human willpower that regardless of sufferings and terrors lasting thousands of years has kept its beautiful nature. This visual novel comprehends such matters as the nature of the human and machine mind as a combination of the conscious and subconscious, coming of age and searching for personal happiness, the origin of interpersonal conflicts, hatred and violence, the willpower and strength to stay human even in the darkest of times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marena Chudskaya</strong>, who calls herself <i>‘an ever-burning star’</i>, is the main character who accidentally falls into a trap designed for the ‘gods’ of the new world. Standing at the crossway of the past and the present, she gets pulled into a conflict with people… beings…  monsters…, who are ready to do whatever it takes to change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two</strong> chapters are available for gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter I: The Zugzwang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter II: Main Residential Complex Sun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two</strong> more chapters are currently in production:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter III: Main Residential Complex Bes’</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter IV: The Bull</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achtung! Attention! Read before playing:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This product may contain visual effects that can trigger epileptic seizures in some individuals. If you experience dizziness, confusion, visual disturbances, or seizures, stop using the product immediately and consult a doctor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
